    "Scouting Notes": "It feels like he should maybe be higher than I have him based on his DSL production, but the tools that I've been able to see all stand out as being more average. Sort of Di Turi esque\n Hit tool should be above average longer term, maybe better, has a good approach\n Power is never going to be huge, but he seems to have an ability to get to it in games a bit with some bat speed\n Great swing decisions, and solid bat to ball skills\n Speed is average\n Defense sounds like a major WIP with a mediocre arm\n It's hard for me to envision a 5'8 guy who only hits and can't really play the field working out, but the bat is super interesting. I may look dumb later on here.",
